arge laundry room. The yard is exceptional, boasting a large deck with gazebo, and gorgeous landscaping with paths, a trellis, and colourful flower beds. This expansive pie-shaped yard backs onto greenspace for added privacy! Situated in the golf course community of Stoneshire. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$724,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","2,013 sq ft"],["Lot size","11,260 sq ft"],["Year built","1990"],["Neighbourhood","Stoneshire"],["Town","Spruce Grove"],["Postal code","T7X3E2"],["MLS® number","E4509253"],["Listed","September 18, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Oversize"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.72 m × 4.09 m (12'2\" × 13'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.16 m × 4.60 m (10'4\" × 15'1\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.65 m × 4.92 m (12'0\" × 16'2\")"],["Family room","Lower level","4.63 m × 5.95 m (15'2\" × 19'6\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.67 m × 3.65 m (15'4\" × 12'0\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.02 m × 2.89 m (9'11\" × 9'6\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.32 m × 3.26 m (10'11\" × 10'8\")"],["Bedroom 4","Lower level","3.30 m × 3.50 m (10'10\" × 11'6\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","5.08 m × 4.59 m (16'8\" × 15'1\")"],["Laundry room","Basement","3.66 m × 2.32 m (12'0\" × 7'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Claude Gaboury, RE/MAX PREFERRED CHOICE and Christina Henker, Century 21 Leading","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"spruce-grove","hood_slug":"stoneshire","area":""}